      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEAM (3) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (26.23) at Hobart. Better than last start and worth following up. MANILA PANDA (2) was prominent throughout off a low draw but dropped right out when 6th over 461m at Hobart in a Grade 6. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Bold showing expected. GOODNIGHT HEIDI (1) racing well without winning, placing at her last five runs. Last time finished 3rd over 600m at this track beaten 6 lengths (35.22) behind Aeroplane Bernie in a Grade 4/5 on September 21. Expected to be in this for a long way. WYNBURN RITA (8) has hardly put a foot wrong of late and will be competitive again.",
